# Copy to `.env` in the repository root. Development, tests and the Prisma CLI read it.
# The packaged desktop app has no .env file: the main process sets DATABASE_URL in code.
#
# This is the built-in local database (user, password, port and name are the defaults in runtime/postgres/db.ts, and
# DB_HOST, DB_PORT, DB_NAME, DB_USER and DB_PASSWORD change them). It listens on 127.0.0.1 only and holds no student records.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://studyplanner_user:superidol@127.0.0.1:5433/studyplanner
